.SH "نام (NAME)"
po2xml \- Translates an DocBook XML file using a PO file
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBpo2xml\fR\ 'u
\fBpo2xml\fR [\fB\fIoriginal\-XML\fR\fR\fB \fR\fB\fItranslated\-PO\fR\fR]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
\fBpo2xml\fR
is a command\-line tool that translates the DocBook XML file
\fIoriginal\-XML\fR
using the gettext message file
\fItranslated\-PO\fR\&. The resulting translated XML file is sent to standard output\&.
.PP
This utility is part of the KDE Software Development Kit\&.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.PP
split2po(1), swappo(1), xml2pot(1)
